                                "sense_id": "0cd3d4b2-cf20-3215-a8d3-517605db86ea",
                                "text": "The steps of the raised temple in which the saint and the basilisk perform have a beautiful intarsia of foliage similar to that on the Giants' Staircase at the Doges' Palace."
